WEBVTT

00:01:29.836 --> 00:01:32.947
Every day, she hurries home from school,
in case he's come back.

00:01:34.042 --> 00:01:36.909
On many nights,
she cries herself to sleep.

00:01:39.212 --> 00:01:41.299
Children at school start to tease her.

00:01:41.323 --> 00:01:42.657
They call her names.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:47.100
Somebody's mum has heard
that Sophie's dad is in prison.

00:01:48.082 --> 00:01:51.129
Sophie pretends to be ill
so she doesn't have to go to school.

00:01:51.749 --> 00:01:54.755
And her teacher can't understand
why she's so far behind

00:01:54.779 --> 00:01:56.125
with her schoolwork.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.863
After what seems
a long, long time to Sophie,